  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.20\n- Added xUnit tests (tests/Seed128.Test): CBC/ECB round-trip and Base64 converter coverage; all green.\n- Enhanced English XML docs and inline comments in Seed and Seed128; XML docs generation enabled.\n- Suppressed CS1591 only for low-level S-Boxes/constants to reduce noise; no behavior changes.\n- Publishing script updated (scripts/publish-nuget.ps1): DryRun no longer requires API key; fixed test path/output dir; corrected package URL.\n- Package metadata refreshed: PackageId renamed to OdinSoft.Security.Seed128; README/license/icon included.\n- AssemblyName set to See.Net (no public API changes); namespaces in code unchanged.\n- Added Microsoft.Extensions.Logging and Abstractions references.",
